00:22:53.444 --> 00:22:57.972
Kokoro ga arawareru

00:22:58.115 --> 00:23:03.314
Hikari wo mitsuketa

00:23:03.487 --> 00:23:08.083
Mezamete iku sora ni

00:23:08.225 --> 00:23:13.663
Anata ga kagayaku no

00:23:13.831 --> 00:23:18.734
Donna ni tooku

00:23:18.903 --> 00:23:23.840
Hanarete ite mo

00:23:24.008 --> 00:23:28.877
Onnaji yoake wo

00:23:29.013 --> 00:23:34.383
Mukaete iru no ne

00:23:34.518 --> 00:23:39.148
Mabushiku kirameku no

00:23:39.290 --> 00:23:44.592
Omoide wo musubu ito

00:23:44.728 --> 00:23:49.791
Mirai no mirai ni mo

00:23:49.934 --> 00:23:54.962
Kamisama ga itekureru

